{"id":"4b3b74411f203273","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-superlow-basis.md","title":"超低基定理","display":"thm-superlow-basis — 超低基定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-superlow-basis","aliases":["43-thm-superlow-basis"],"display":"thm-superlow-basis — 超低基定理","depends_on":["[[43-df-infseq]]","[[43-df-pi01class]]","[[43-df-superlow]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Corollary 5.16.8, print p.65 / PDF p.85","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-superlow-basis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-superlow-basis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-superlow-basis — 超低基定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" href=\"?note=cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" title=\"43-df-pi01class\">43-df-pi01class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b9d3cac15352fc5d\" href=\"?note=b9d3cac15352fc5d\" title=\"43-df-superlow\">43-df-superlow</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Corollary 5.16.8, print p.65 / PDF p.85"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSet}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSet}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>；Superlow见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b9d3cac15352fc5d\" href=\"?note=b9d3cac15352fc5d\" title=\"43-df-superlow\">43-df-superlow</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathcal C\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\\exists X\\in\\mathcal C\\ \\operatorname{Superlow}(\\operatorname{AsSet}(X)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathcal C\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\\exists X\\in\\mathcal C\\ \\operatorname{Superlow}(\\operatorname{AsSet}(X)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是低基构造的有界变更加强，超低见证仍属于给定有效闭类；不要求同一见证同时满足hyperimmune-free基性质。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 5.16.8, print p.65 / PDF p.85。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pi01class","status":"resolved","id":"cc07cf2b9ec0019e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pi01class]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-superlow","status":"resolved","id":"b9d3cac15352fc5d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-superlow]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{AsSet}$ 采用 [[43-df-infseq]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-superlow","status":"resolved","id":"b9d3cac15352fc5d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega$；Superlow见 [[43-df-superlow]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{AsSet}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathcal C\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\\exists X\\in\\mathcal C\\ \\operatorname{Superlow}(\\operatorname{AsSet}(X)).","display":true}],"bytes":1080,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-80","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-superlow-basis]] — 超低基定理"}],"outgoing":["565c3258eee2a5ff","cc07cf2b9ec0019e","b9d3cac15352fc5d"]}